Package: com.r0gueee.theosstudio
Name: TheosStudio
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Section: Development
Priority: optional
Maintainer: r0gueee <r0gueee@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: firmware (>= 15.0), bash, clang, coreutils, curl, git, grep, ldid, make, perl, rsync, xz-utils
Description: Self-contained on-device Theos development environment
 Projects, a Logos editor, a bundled Theos checkout and patched iOS SDK, plus
 the native compiler/build utilities required to build, package and install
 tweaks on a jailbroken device.
 .
 Native executables are declared as package dependencies so the jailbreak's
 package manager installs ABI-compatible builds for its bootstrap. The app
 prefers its bundled Theos and SDK while exposing the bootstrap tools on PATH.
 .
 Packages install to /var/jb/Applications on a rootless jailbreak and to
 /Applications on a rootful one.
Homepage: https://github.com/R0GUEEE/TheosStudio
